; ユキ
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:――だから。|#0205Adv06_Yuki005| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆優しく
; ユキ　閉眼
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:私が魔女を――【殺さない】魔法をかけます。|#0205Adv06_Yuki006| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:その声は、<br>暗闇をそっと溶かすように優しく。|#0205Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:ボクたちに寄り添い、<br>包み込んでくれる温もりを感じた。|#0205Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@SpawnExtended Path:MaskingRectangle Params:40,200,true,0.3,#000000 ScenePosition:20,50 Rotation:,,0 SubId:Front
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:-20,36 AppearanceAndTransition:14_1 SubId:Front
@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,32 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Surprised1 SubId:Front
