[PrintTextModified Text:友だちだからだ……！|#0205Adv06_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:ユキの気持ちをわかってやれ……！|#0205Adv06_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

